  <!-- RITUEL -->
  <section class="mrp-ritual">
    <div class="mrp-wrap">
      <div class="mrp-rhead mrp-rv">
        <p class="mrp-eyebrow mrp-line-both" style="justify-content:center;">Le rituel du soir</p>
        <h2 class="mrp-h">Simple. 2 minutes. Chaque soir.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mrp-steps">
        <div class="mrp-step mrp-rv">
          <div class="mrp-step__img">{%- if s.ritual_image_1 != blank -%}{{ s.ritual_image_1 | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: "Déposer l'huile de Batana" }}{%- else -%}<div class="mrp-ph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M12 3s6 6.5 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.5 6-11 6-11Z"/></svg></div>{%- endif -%}</div>
          <div class="mrp-step__body"><div class="mrp-step__n">01</div><div class="mrp-step__t">Déposez</div><div class="mrp-step__d">Quelques gouttes sur le cuir chevelu et les longueurs, mèche par mèche.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mrp-step mrp-rv">
          <div class="mrp-step__img">{%- if s.ritual_image_2 != blank -%}{{ s.ritual_image_2 | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: "Masser le cuir chevelu" }}{%- else -%}<div class="mrp-ph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M8 13c0-3 2-5 4-5s4 2 4 5M6 20h12"/><path d="M12 3v3"/></svg></div>{%- endif -%}</div>
          <div class="mrp-step__body"><div class="mrp-step__n">02</div><div class="mrp-step__t">Massez</div><div class="mrp-step__d">2 minutes du bout des doigts, pour stimuler et détendre le cuir chevelu.</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mrp-step mrp-rv">
          <div class="mrp-step__img">{%- if s.ritual_image_3 != blank -%}{{ s.ritual_image_3 | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: "Laisser poser toute la nuit" }}{%- else -%}<div class="mrp-ph"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.8Z"/></svg></div>{%- endif -%}</div>
          <div class="mrp-step__body"><div class="mrp-step__n">03</div><div class="mrp-step__t">Laissez poser</div><div class="mrp-step__d">Idéalement toute la nuit. Rincez ou laissez selon la texture de vos cheveux.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mrp-uses">
        <div class="mrp-use mrp-rv"><b>Cure cuir chevelu</b><span>Sur cuir chevelu sec, <em>3 à 4 fois / semaine</em>, pour une chevelure d'apparence plus dense.</span></div>
        <div class="mrp-use mrp-rv"><b>Soin des longueurs</b><span>Quelques gouttes sur cheveux secs ou humides, <em>2 à 3 fois / semaine</em>, pour nourrir et discipliner.</span></div>
        <div class="mrp-use mrp-rv"><b>Masque de nuit</b><span>En couche généreuse le soir, <em>1 fois / semaine</em>, puis lavez au matin pour un soin profond.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- COMPARAISON -->
  <section class="mrp-compare">
    <div class="mrp-wrap mrp-rv">
      <p class="mrp-eyebrow mrp-line-both" style="justify-content:center;">Pourquoi myrootelia</p>
      <h2 class="mrp-h">Toutes les huiles de Batana ne se valent pas</h2>
      <div class="mrp-table">
        <div class="mrp-row mrp-row--head">
          <div class="mrp-lbl"></div>
          <div class="mrp-us">myrootelia</div>
          <div class="mrp-them">Huiles génériques</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mrp-row"><div class="mrp-lbl">100 % Batana pur (non dilué)</div><div class="mrp-us"><span class="mrp-tick">✓</span></div><div class="mrp-them">Souvent mélangée</div></div>
        <div class="mrp-row"><div class="mrp-lbl">Origine tracée (Honduras)</div><div class="mrp-us"><span class="mrp-tick">✓</span></div><div class="mrp-them">Rarement</div></div>
        <div class="mrp-row"><div class="mrp-lbl">Pressée à froid</div><div class="mrp-us"><span class="mrp-tick">✓</span></div><div class="mrp-them">Variable</div></div>
        <div class="mrp-row"><div class="mrp-lbl">Sans additifs ni conservateurs</div><div class="mrp-us"><span class="mrp-tick">✓</span></div><div class="mrp-them">Variable</div></div>
        <div class="mrp-row"><div class="mrp-lbl">Récoltée à la main</div><div class="mrp-us"><span class="mrp-tick">✓</span></div><div class="mrp-them">✕</div></div>
        <div class="mrp-row"><div class="mrp-lbl">Discours honnête, sans promesse miracle</div><div class="mrp-us"><span class="mrp-tick">✓</span></div><div class="mrp-them">Allégations exagérées</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
